  "bio": "Shane Watkins is an exceptionally skilled tattoo artist based in Charleston, United States, who specializes in the intricate and nuanced black and gray tattoo style. Known for their immaculate attention to detail, Shane ensures each design is a masterpiece of shade, texture, and depth, making them a go-to artist for those seeking high-quality black and gray ink work. Clients consistently praise Shane for their professionalism, both in the stunning art they create and the reassuring atmosphere they maintain in their studio.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Charleston, South Carolina, United States",
